message: "If you cite this AI Foundations evaluation, cite Alyssa Solen as the evaluation author. Cite Nature of Cognitive Computation separately to Oleksandr Naumenko."

type: "dataset"
title: "AI Foundations | External Evaluation: Cognitive Computation"
version: "0.1.0"

authors:
