abstract: "AI Foundations external evaluation of Nature of Cognitive Computation by Oleksandr Naumenko. This repository extracts and evaluates registered claims concerning comparison-based cognitive computation, option-and-constraint selection, semantic binary search, dimensionality reduction, hierarchical recognition, property ranges, and related proposed mechanisms. AI Foundations is the evaluator; the independently authored external source remains external to AI Foundations and is not incorporated into AI Foundations or AI Foundations canon by citation, testing, or evaluation."

